# "If you controlled a Mount as you cast this spell" (CR 601.2i): the board as the spell was cast is what counts. With Steer Clear on the
# stack Bot1 sacrifices its Bulwark Ox (a Mount) in response, and Bot2's attacking Arni still takes 4, not 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Bulwark Ox
Steer Clear
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Arni, Renowned Champion
Island x14

